Dialogue: 10,0:00:02.48,0:00:06.69,Default,Nh,0,0,0,,The only provinces that haven't sent any messengers to Imagawa's new administration
Dialogue: 10,0:00:06.69,0:00:08.61,Default,,0,0,0,,are Wakasa and Echizen.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:08.61,0:00:10.32,Default,N,0,0,0,,Echizen?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:10.32,0:00:12.32,Default,N,0,0,0,,Asakura Yoshikage.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:12.32,0:00:15.24,Default,Nh,0,0,0,,The powerful monk of Hiei Mountain, Shoukakuin...
Dialogue: 10,0:00:16.05,0:00:18.92,Default,Nh,0,0,0,,the ruler of Sakai, Tsuda Soukyuu...
Dialogue: 10,0:00:18.92,0:00:22.72,Default,Nh,0,0,0,,{\q3}and the leader of the conspirators, the imperial adviser, Konoe Sakihisa.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:22.72,0:00:23.75,Default,Nh,0,0,0,,Disgusting.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:25.18,0:00:27.24,Default,K,0,0,0,,Let's kill them all!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:27.24,0:00:29.09,Default,S,0,0,0,,They're all powerful people.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:29.09,0:00:31.56,Default,S,0,0,0,,We can't kill them without proof.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:31.56,0:00:33.38,Default,K,0,0,0,,Isn't Danjo proof enough?!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:33.77,0:00:37.02,Default,D,0,0,0,,My testimony would be ridiculed.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:38.07,0:00:39.78,Default,K,0,0,0,,Then we attack Asakura!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:41.02,0:00:43.52,Default,H,0,0,0,,Asakura is allied with the Asai Clan.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:44.48,0:00:47.62,Default,N,0,0,0,,Kanjuurou is in Asai, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:49.02,0:00:50.99,Default,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}In my history,
Dialogue: 10,0:00:50.99,0:00:54.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Nobunaga attacked Asakura in Echizen regardless.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:54.30,0:00:56.03,Default,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}And the result...
Dialogue: 10,0:00:56.78,0:00:58.35,Default,N,0,0,0,,We attack Wakasa.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:59.31,0:01:01.62,Default,N,0,0,0,,It'll make Asakura think twice before acting.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:01.62,0:01:04.16,Default,N,0,0,0,,Tell everyone we'll be striking Wakasa.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:04.53,0:01:05.90,Default,S,0,0,0,,It {\i1}will{\i0} be Wakasa, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:05.90,0:01:07.42,Default,S,0,0,0,,Not Echizen?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:08.92,0:01:09.98,Default,S,0,0,0,,Nobuna!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:10.99,0:01:12.61,Default,N,0,0,0,,Th-That's right.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:12.61,0:01:13.51,Default,N,0,0,0,,That's what I said.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:15.38,0:01:17.47,Default,A,0,0,0,,I know all about Wakasa!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:17.47,0:01:18.76,Default,A,0,0,0,,Let me take the lead.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:18.76,0:01:20.94,Default,N,0,0,0,,Sure. Go get 'em.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:20.94,0:01:22.40,Default,A,0,0,0,,Leave it to me!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:22.40,0:01:24.56,Default,Nh,0,0,0,,Then who will protect Kyo?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:26.01,0:01:27.52,Default,N,0,0,0,,We'll leave Monkey.
