Dialogue: 10,0:03:02.03,0:03:05.41,Default,S,0,0,0,,She's calling in reinforcements from Mikawa, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:05.41,0:03:07.75,Default,S,0,0,0,,Why do {\i1}I{\i0} have to stay behind?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:09.29,0:03:13.69,Default,A,0,0,0,,Quit complaining and just protect Kyo.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:13.69,0:03:16.04,Default,S,0,0,0,,That's supposed to be {\i1}your{\i0} job.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:16.04,0:03:17.05,Default,A,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:17.68,0:03:21.84,Default,A,0,0,0,,So, you need to do as good a job as I would, Mister Monkey.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:23.60,0:03:24.70,Default,S,0,0,0,,A charm?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:24.70,0:03:27.30,Default,A,0,0,0,,I-I knitted it myself.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:27.30,0:03:28.72,Default,A,0,0,0,,You'd better be grateful!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:28.72,0:03:30.34,Default,S,0,0,0,,I'm not taking that!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:30.34,0:03:31.06,Default,S,0,0,0,,It's embarrassing.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:31.06,0:03:32.10,Default,A,0,0,0,,Just take it!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:33.53,0:03:36.11,Default,A,0,0,0,,I don't want you dying.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:37.13,0:03:39.21,Default,S,0,0,0,,All I'm doing is staying here.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:39.21,0:03:41.36,Default,A,0,0,0,,We don't know what will happen.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:42.95,0:03:46.74,Default,A,0,0,0,,{\q3}You and I are going to help Lord Nobuna conquer Japan!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:47.13,0:03:50.25,Default,A,0,0,0,,I won't have you leaving us before she's done.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:57.51,0:03:59.63,Default,Ka,0,0,0,,Having to secretly use the women's bath...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:00.09,0:04:03.59,Default,Ka,0,0,0,,I'd rather bathe with a bunch of cute girls around.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:07.61,0:04:08.26,Default,Ka,0,0,0,,Who's there?!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:10.53,0:04:12.59,Default,Ka,0,0,0,,Oh, it's you, Nagamasa.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:12.59,0:04:15.02,Default,Ka,0,0,0,,You like going into the women's bath, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:16.22,0:04:19.15,Default,Nm,0,0,0,,W-Why you... You're a man?!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:21.10,0:04:22.84,Default,Ka,0,0,0,,So you found out, huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:22.84,0:04:26.50,Default,Ka,0,0,0,,It was a complete lie that I was Nobuna's sister, Princess Oichi.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:26.50,0:04:30.04,Default,Ka,0,0,0,,I am Tsuda Nobusumi, a man!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:30.04,0:04:32.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-You're a woman?!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:37.96,0:04:41.38,Default,Nm,0,0,0,,So, Nobuna knew I was the princess of Asai
Dialogue: 10,0:04:41.38,0:04:43.88,Default,Nm,0,0,0,,and sent a man to marry me?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:43.88,0:04:45.93,Default,Nm,0,0,0,,What a fearsome woman.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:45.93,0:04:49.50,Default,Ka,0,0,0,,Ah, no. My sister didn't...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:49.50,0:04:51.48,Default,Ka,0,0,0,,But why?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:51.48,0:04:54.10,Default,Ka,0,0,0,,What's wrong with having a female count?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:55.34,0:04:57.68,Default,Nm,0,0,0,,My father was very stubborn.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:57.68,0:05:00.36,Default,Nm,0,0,0,,No matter how chic female counts are, he would never allow it.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:01.39,0:05:03.25,Default,Nm,0,0,0,,"If you want to lead the Asai Clan,
Dialogue: 10,0:05:03.25,0:05:05.95,Default,,0,0,0,,stop being a woman and become a man."
Dialogue: 10,0:05:05.95,0:05:07.80,Default,Nm,0,0,0,,"If you choose to be a woman,
Dialogue: 10,0:05:07.80,0:05:10.03,Default,,0,0,0,,you will have to go to the Rokkaku as a hostage."
Dialogue: 10,0:05:12.85,0:05:15.41,Default,Ka,0,0,0,,I guess all families have their issues.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:16.61,0:05:18.85,Default,Nm,0,0,0,,If I had to abandon being a woman,
Dialogue: 10,0:05:18.85,0:05:21.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I decided that I would be a real man.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:21.55,0:05:23.96,Default,Nm,0,0,0,,I would seduce and use women,
Dialogue: 10,0:05:24.40,0:05:25.99,Default,Nm,0,0,0,,and make the Asai rulers{\fscx200}-
Dialogue: 10,0:05:25.99,0:05:28.59,Default,Ka,0,0,0,,You don't really need to stop being a woman.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:28.59,0:05:30.14,Default,Nm,0,0,0,,You think I could do that?!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:31.90,0:05:32.89,Default,Ka,0,0,0,,You can.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:33.43,0:05:35.39,Default,Ka,0,0,0,,We're married, aren't we?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:36.85,0:05:38.48,Default,Ka,0,0,0,,Okay, I've decided!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:38.48,0:05:40.17,Default,Ka,0,0,0,,When we're alone together,
Dialogue: 10,0:05:40.17,0:05:42.11,Default,,0,0,0,,go back to being a woman!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:43.39,0:05:46.11,Default,Ka,0,0,0,,This is our secret.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:48.26,0:05:49.20,Default,Ka,0,0,0,,Okay?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:49.20,0:05:52.17,Default,Ka,0,0,0,,From now on, you're my wife.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:02.91,0:06:05.58,Default,Y,0,0,0,,Understood, Hisamasa?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:17.53,0:06:20.84,Default,Narr,0,0,0,,The 30,000 soldiers who left Kyo with Nobuna
