Dialogue: 10,0:06:25.15,0:06:27.94,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,The Asai Clan has granted us passage through Oumi.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:27.94,0:06:30.87,Default,N,0,0,0,,Okay, let's get going.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:31.35,0:06:32.99,Default,Ne,0,0,0,,Nene is here!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:34.14,0:06:36.00,Default,S,0,0,0,,Why are you here?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:36.51,0:06:41.52,Default,Ne,0,0,0,,The princess has asked me to make sure you don't fool around with any girls.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:41.52,0:06:43.13,Default,S,0,0,0,,That damn Nobuna...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:45.53,0:06:47.56,Default,S,0,0,0,,Are you okay, Hanbei?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:47.56,0:06:48.97,Default,H,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:48.97,0:06:52.64,Default,H,0,0,0,,I think I used too much of my power at Kiyomizu Temple.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:55.76,0:06:58.27,Default,G,0,0,0,,Do you know a way to lower her fever?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:59.17,0:07:01.02,Default,S,0,0,0,,Cool her under her arms?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:01.02,0:07:02.77,Default,Ne,0,0,0,,Under her arms, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:09.80,0:07:11.95,Default,H,0,0,0,,Don't look, Mr. Yoshiharu!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:12.35,0:07:15.95,Default,S,0,0,0,,C-C-Cool her under her arms with a wet cloth!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:15.95,0:07:17.83,Default,Ne,0,0,0,,Understood!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:22.71,0:07:24.38,Default,H,0,0,0,,It tickles.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:24.89,0:07:26.60,Default,G,0,0,0,,Your face is red.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:26.60,0:07:28.09,Default,I,0,0,0,,Hey, you turned on?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:28.09,0:07:29.73,Default,H,0,0,0,,Heck no!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:32.07,0:07:34.51,Default,Nh,0,0,0,,Kuniyoshi Castle has surrendered without a fight.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:34.51,0:07:36.00,Default,N,0,0,0,,It's all going well so far.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:37.36,0:07:39.73,Default,N,0,0,0,,How far is it to Kanegasaki Castle?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:39.73,0:07:42.02,Default,A,0,0,0,,I suppose it's about a half-day's ride?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:42.73,0:07:44.81,Default,Nh,0,0,0,,That's in Echizen.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:46.06,0:07:47.27,Default,N,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:47.27,0:07:50.90,Default,S,0,0,0,,I was sure Nobuna would hit Echizen.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:50.90,0:07:53.16,Default,G,0,0,0,,That would cause problems for the Asai.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:53.16,0:07:54.41,Default,S,0,0,0,,Sure would.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:54.41,0:07:58.02,Default,S,0,0,0,,In my games, when she attacks Echizen,
Dialogue: 10,0:07:58.02,0:08:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,she's betrayed by the Asai behind her.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:01.63,0:08:05.54,Default,S,0,0,0,,The Oda forces are cut off from Kyo and in grave danger.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:05.54,0:08:08.65,Default,S,0,0,0,,It's a major event in Lord Nobunaga's Ambition.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:08.65,0:08:10.68,Default,S,0,0,0,,The Retreat at Kanegasaki.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:10.68,0:08:12.19,Default,H,0,0,0,,Lord Nobuna is in danger!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:13.27,0:08:14.66,Default,N,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:14.66,0:08:15.93,Default,N,0,0,0,,She went to Wakasa.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:15.93,0:08:17.83,Default,H,0,0,0,,That was a lie.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:17.83,0:08:22.58,Default,H,0,0,0,,Her real plan was to go east as soon as she entered Wakasa,
Dialogue: 10,0:08:22.58,0:08:24.44,Default,H,0,0,0,,and launch a surprise attack on Echizen.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:24.44,0:08:26.19,Default,N,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:26.59,0:08:27.80,Default,H,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:27.80,0:08:32.11,Default,H,0,0,0,,If I'd known what would happen at Kanegasaki...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:33.16,0:08:35.53,Default,Nm,0,0,0,,Father, please reconsider!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:35.87,0:08:41.41,Default,Yo,0,0,0,,Until Oda Nobuna is slain, \NI'm taking back control of the clan.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:41.41,0:08:44.04,Default,Nm,0,0,0,,Nobuna is my sister-in-law!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:44.51,0:08:48.42,Default,Yo,0,0,0,,I want {\i1}you{\i0} to be the one to rule Japan!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:48.42,0:08:50.92,Default,Nm,0,0,0,,F-Father, please!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:51.40,0:08:52.55,Default,Nm,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:57.95,0:09:00.42,Default,H,0,0,0,,If the Asai armies cutoff her line of retreat,
Dialogue: 10,0:09:00.42,0:09:03.05,Default,,0,0,0,,her armies will be stranded in enemy territory.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:03.05,0:09:07.44,Default,H,0,0,0,,They'll be caught between the Asai and Asakura armies, and be annihilated.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:07.44,0:09:09.06,Default,I,0,0,0,,We must tell the princess.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:09.06,0:09:11.15,Default,S,0,0,0,,Find out what Nagamasa is doing.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:11.15,0:09:12.28,Default,S,0,0,0,,Odani is our first priority.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:12.28,0:09:13.19,Default,H,0,0,0,,I'll go, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:15.29,0:09:17.66,Default,S,0,0,0,,You need to rest.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:17.66,0:09:21.79,Default,H,0,0,0,,Th-Then, I'll send Zenki in my place.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:35.94,0:09:38.14,Default,Yo,0,0,0,,Oda's entered Echizen?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:39.10,0:09:42.64,Default,Yo,0,0,0,,With this, Oda Nobuna is mine.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:46.55,0:09:49.27,Default,Soldiers,0,0,0,,Please return, Miss Oichi!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:52.54,0:09:54.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Ouch.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:58.91,0:10:00.93,Default,S,0,0,0,,Are you okay, Nobusumi?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:00.93,0:10:01.91,Default,Ka,0,0,0,,Monkey!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:02.33,0:10:04.60,Default,S,0,0,0,,What happened? Where's Nagamasa?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:04.60,0:10:06.12,Default,Ka,0,0,0,,Imprisoned.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:06.12,0:10:07.40,Default,S,0,0,0,,Imprisoned?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:07.92,0:10:09.57,Default,Ka,0,0,0,,Give this to my sister!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:10.42,0:10:11.96,Default,S,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:15.90,0:10:17.72,Default,Soldiers,0,0,0,,A fox monster?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:17.72,0:10:19.56,Default,Ka,0,0,0,,Go, Monkey!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:19.56,0:10:20.81,Default,S,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:20.81,0:10:22.10,Default,S,0,0,0,,I have to save—
Dialogue: 10,0:10:21.33,0:10:22.10,Alt,Ka,0,0,0,,I'm fine!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:23.57,0:10:26.35,Default,Ka,0,0,0,,Besides, there's someone I can't leave behind.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:26.35,0:10:28.10,Default,S,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:31.23,0:10:32.94,Default,Ka,0,0,0,,Fine!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:32.94,0:10:33.98,Default,Ka,0,0,0,,Zenki!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:35.01,0:10:37.36,Default,S,0,0,0,,Nobusumi... don't die on me.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:41.49,0:10:44.28,Default,Ka,0,0,0,,My sister's in your hands, Monkey.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:46.52,0:10:48.75,Default,K,0,0,0,,Kanegasaki Castle has fallen.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.75,0:10:54.75,Map - Brush,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.5\fax0.4\fs37.5\c&H465E91&\b1\frz39.55\frx12\fry354\pos(268.5,711)}Ichijoudani Castle
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.75,0:10:54.75,Map - Brush,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.5\fax0.35\fs37.5\c&H5E7AB2&\b1\frx10\fry352\frz40.86\pos(726,501)}Kinome Pass
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.75,0:10:54.75,Map - Brush,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.5\fax0.32\fs37.5\c&H5877A7&\b1\frx20\fry352\frz47.56\pos(1107,309)}Kanegasaki{\fsp-10.5} {\fsp0}Castle
Dialogue: 10,0:10:49.71,0:10:52.06,Default,N,0,0,0,,If we cross Kinome Pass from here,
Dialogue: 10,0:10:52.06,0:10:54.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Echizen and Ichijoudani Castle are right there.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:55.22,0:10:57.32,Default,Nh,0,0,0,,But there are 20,000 Asakura soldiers.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:57.32,0:11:00.62,Default,Nh,0,0,0,,We're about to face a real counterattack.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:00.62,0:11:02.70,Default,N,0,0,0,,We'll finish it before then.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:04.10,0:11:05.70,Default,N,0,0,0,,Monkey, what are you doing here?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:05.70,0:11:06.77,Default,S,0,0,0,,Nobuna!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:06.77,0:11:08.08,Default,S,0,0,0,,Retreat!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:08.08,0:11:09.46,Default,S,0,0,0,,Asai has betrayed you.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:10.79,0:11:13.42,Default,S,0,0,0,,The Oda armies are just like this pouch,
Dialogue: 10,0:11:14.17,0:11:15.27,Default,S,0,0,0,,blocked in on both sides!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:15.27,0:11:16.58,Default,S,0,0,0,,We'll be wiped out!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:17.31,0:11:18.54,Default,N,0,0,0,,No way...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:21.95,0:11:24.75,Default,N,0,0,0,,Wh-What are you talking about, Monkey?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:24.75,0:11:26.54,Default,N,0,0,0,,Asai can't betray us...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:27.64,0:11:29.71,Default,N,0,0,0,,Kanjuurou's married there.{huh? -GBF}
Dialogue: 10,0:11:29.71,0:11:32.71,Default,S,0,0,0,,{\q3}The one who brought me that pouch was Nobusumi.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:34.09,0:11:35.96,Default,S,0,0,0,,Nagamasa's been imprisoned.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:35.96,0:11:39.71,Default,S,0,0,0,,Hisamasa has taken over the Asai clan.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:39.71,0:11:42.97,Default,N,0,0,0,,He may be stupid, but still, that's...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:42.97,0:11:44.85,Default,S,0,0,0,,I was careless.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:44.85,0:11:48.70,Default,S,0,0,0,,I knew this would happen if you attacked Echizen.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:49.23,0:11:51.31,Default,S,0,0,0,,I was so relieved by what you said.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:51.31,0:11:52.82,Default,S,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:53.42,0:11:55.26,Default,N,0,0,0,,No, Monkey.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:55.73,0:11:59.74,Default,N,0,0,0,,If I'd told the truth from the beginning...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:00.15,0:12:03.61,Default,N,0,0,0,,It felt like you could read my mind, so I...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:03.61,0:12:04.64,Default,S,0,0,0,,Nobuna...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:05.42,0:12:06.62,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,Reporting.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:06.62,0:12:09.24,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,The Asakura forces have entered Kinome Pass.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:13.54,0:12:16.79,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,The famous warriors Magara Naoki and Naozumi are leading the way.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:16.79,0:12:19.55,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,They're coming fast.{SPLIT}
Dialogue: 10,0:12:19.55,0:12:21.67,Default,K,0,0,0,,Princess, we must withdraw!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:22.97,0:12:26.09,Default,N,0,0,0,,I'll draw them away from the rear.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:26.09,0:12:26.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Escape then—
Dialogue: 10,0:12:26.68,0:12:29.68,Default,Nh,0,0,0,,No, you can't fight an army that size!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:30.55,0:12:33.44,Default,N,0,0,0,,Who can I ask to do it?!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:33.44,0:12:36.45,Default,N,0,0,0,,I don't want to let anyone die!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:36.45,0:12:39.28,Default,Nh,0,0,0,,You're asking the impossible.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:40.25,0:12:42.44,Default,N,0,0,0,,Then... surrender.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:42.44,0:12:43.87,Default,N,0,0,0,,We'll surrender.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:43.87,0:12:46.20,Default,K,0,0,0,,Are you going to give upon conquering Japan?!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:46.87,0:12:49.86,Default,N,0,0,0,,It's not worth everyone's life.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:49.86,0:12:53.04,Default,N,0,0,0,,If a female count becomes a nun, she won't be killed.{wtf is this line, I don't even... TLC PLZ -GBF}
Dialogue: 10,0:12:53.04,0:12:56.17,Default,D,0,0,0,,If you surrender, you {\i1}will{\i0} be killed.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:56.65,0:13:02.67,Default,D,0,0,0,,{\q3}After a betrayal of this size, they'll be coming to kill you.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:04.93,0:13:06.22,Default,Nh,0,0,0,,The Oda Clan—
Dialogue: 10,0:13:06.22,0:13:11.13,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Japan itself, cannot survive without you.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:12.29,0:13:14.60,Default,Nh,0,0,0,,Order one of your retainers to guard the rear.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:15.84,0:13:17.90,Default,Nh,0,0,0,,Order them to die.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:19.22,0:13:20.11,Default,N,0,0,0,,I won't.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:20.57,0:13:23.12,Default,Nh,0,0,0,,If you want to conquer, then people {\i1}will{\i0} die for it!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:23.61,0:13:25.20,Default,Nh,0,0,0,,Accept it.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:25.20,0:13:28.48,Default,N,0,0,0,,I-I can't order someone to—
Dialogue: 10,0:13:28.48,0:13:30.20,Default,S,0,0,0,,So, of course, I'll do it.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:31.41,0:13:32.50,Default,K,0,0,0,,Don't be stupid!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:32.50,0:13:33.45,Default,K,0,0,0,,I will!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:33.83,0:13:37.71,Default,S,0,0,0,,How are the Oda going to conquer Japan without their finest warrior?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:39.21,0:13:42.21,Default,N,0,0,0,,Monkey, why would you...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:42.82,0:13:49.22,Default,S,0,0,0,,If I hadn't met you, I would've died all alone in a ditch{on a road} somewhere.{I'll leave this to QC's discretion(unless we got TLC). It makes more sense to me to die in a ditch than on a road(at least in a world with no cars XD), and it's not uncommon for ditches to be on the side of roads. -GBF}
Dialogue: 10,0:13:49.88,0:13:52.31,Default,S,0,0,0,,To help Oda Nobuna conquer,
Dialogue: 10,0:13:52.31,0:13:54.83,Default,,0,0,0,,and then sail the Seven Seas with her...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:54.83,0:13:56.77,Default,S,0,0,0,,An incredible dream, isn't it?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:57.64,0:14:03.23,Default,S,0,0,0,,But thanks to that, I was able to live my life looking forward, not backwards.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:03.23,0:14:05.48,Default,S,0,0,0,,If you abandon your conquest,
Dialogue: 10,0:14:05.48,0:14:08.49,Default,,0,0,0,,then my life in this world is over.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:08.49,0:14:10.49,Default,N,0,0,0,,Monkey.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:13.75,0:14:16.50,Default,S,0,0,0,,This connects this time and the future.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:16.97,0:14:19.27,Default,S,0,0,0,,It's like a futuristic pocket watch.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:19.27,0:14:20.79,Default,S,0,0,0,,My dad gave it to me.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:22.67,0:14:24.88,Default,N,0,0,0,,You have a father in the future...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:25.29,0:14:29.62,Default,S,0,0,0,,If you don't do your best, our future will disappear.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:30.25,0:14:35.82,Default,S,0,0,0,,You're the only one who can destroy the old world and bring about the world I lived in.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:39.98,0:14:41.15,Default,N,0,0,0,,You liar!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:41.63,0:14:45.65,Default,N,0,0,0,,You said you'd stay with me until my dream came true!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:45.65,0:14:49.15,Default,N,0,0,0,,Liar! Liar! Liar!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:56.13,0:14:57.59,Default,S,0,0,0,,Listen to me.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:57.59,0:15:01.92,Default,S,0,0,0,,If you let any of the others guard the rear, they'll die.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:03.31,0:15:08.92,Default,S,0,0,0,,{\q3\i1}But if I was called here as a replacement for Toyotomi Hideyoshi...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:08.93,0:15:10.13,Default,N,0,0,0,,You'll die!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:11.18,0:15:12.68,Default,N,0,0,0,,You'll be killed!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:14.91,0:15:16.01,Default,N,0,0,0,,Because...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:18.58,0:15:24.50,Default,N,0,0,0,,Because everyone I love dies.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:28.43,0:15:31.26,Default,S,0,0,0,,I came to this time for you.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:31.78,0:15:33.91,Default,S,0,0,0,,So I promise,
Dialogue: 10,0:15:33.91,0:15:36.79,Default,S,0,0,0,,I won't do anything to make you sad.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:38.19,0:15:39.34,Default,N,0,0,0,,Monkey...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:40.04,0:15:42.02,Default,S,0,0,0,,When you make it back safe,
Dialogue: 10,0:15:42.53,0:15:44.74,Default,S,0,0,0,,and I come back alive,
Dialogue: 10,0:15:44.74,0:15:48.63,Default,S,0,0,0,,this time I'm taking the best prize in Japan.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:49.22,0:15:50.70,Default,S,0,0,0,,Let me kiss you.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:50.70,0:15:51.63,Default,N,0,0,0,,Kiss?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:52.07,0:15:54.66,Default,S,0,0,0,,As in, on the lips.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:57.27,0:15:58.46,Default,N,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:09.78,0:16:11.78,Default,N,0,0,0,,You're still here?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:11.78,0:16:16.12,Default,M,0,0,0,,Mikawa was able to become independent because of you, Mr. Monkeyharu.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:16.12,0:16:17.78,Default,M,0,0,0,,I want to repay you for that.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:18.25,0:16:20.04,Default,S,0,0,0,,It's fine. Go.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:20.04,0:16:21.09,Default,M,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:21.84,0:16:26.34,Default,S,0,0,0,,If we don't have anybody left to rule the country after Japan's united, we're in trouble.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:26.88,0:16:30.22,Default,M,0,0,0,,Once the country's at peace, you, Ieyasu—
Dialogue: 10,0:16:30.22,0:16:33.40,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Motoyasu, will be the best one to rule it.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:33.40,0:16:34.79,Default,M,0,0,0,,And Juubei...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:34.79,0:16:37.39,Default,M,0,0,0,,you will cross the sea with Nobuna.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:37.39,0:16:39.51,Default,A,0,0,0,,G-Go out to the rest of the world?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:39.51,0:16:40.50,Default,S,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:41.17,0:16:43.22,Default,S,0,0,0,,So, both of you must live.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:43.22,0:16:44.39,Default,S,0,0,0,,For Nobuna's sake.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:48.19,0:16:50.56,Default,M,0,0,0,,I'll leave Mr. Hanzou.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:50.56,0:16:52.44,Default,M,0,0,0,,He wants to stay.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:52.45,0:16:53.76,Default,S,0,0,0,,Hanzou does?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:56.16,0:16:57.46,Default,A,0,0,0,,If you die,
Dialogue: 10,0:16:57.46,0:17:00.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll laugh and say you were never a match for me.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:00.45,0:17:02.46,Default,S,0,0,0,,I won't die.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:02.46,0:17:05.21,Default,S,0,0,0,,Or doesn't this thing work at all?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:05.21,0:17:07.34,Default,A,0,0,0,,It'll work a treat!{I was tempted to put "It'll work like a charm!". XD -GBF}
Dialogue: 10,0:17:07.34,0:17:09.34,Default,A,0,0,0,,You won't die no matter what happens!
