Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.43,0:17:23.47,Map - Brush,,0,0,0,,{\fscx77\t(-68,31,\fscx78)\fscy77\t(-68,31,\fscy78)\blur1.5\an5\fax0.06\shad7.5\4a&A7&\c&H18283E&\4c&H1F3C51&\fs84\frz0.5879\frx36\fry356\pos(633.645,965.475)}Oumi
Dialogue: 10,0:17:24.64,0:17:26.11,Default,Narr,0,0,0,,Yoshiharu was the rear guard,
Dialogue: 10,0:17:26.11,0:17:31.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q3}and with 500 men, was tasked with delaying the enemy as best he could.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:32.81,0:17:35.37,Default,Narr,0,0,0,,Meanwhile, the Oda army would force their way
Dialogue: 10,0:17:35.37,0:17:38.83,Default,,0,0,0,,through Kutsuki Valley, in Asai territory, and head for Kyo.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:38.83,0:17:41.88,Default,Narr,0,0,0,,That was the only way to escape.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:44.12,0:17:46.21,Default,Nm,0,0,0,,Crush them!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:50.57,0:17:51.60,Default,Nm,0,0,0,,Don't be afraid!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:51.60,0:17:53.49,Default,Nm,0,0,0,,They have to reload their rifles!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:53.49,0:17:54.80,Default,Nk,0,0,0,,Go now!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:58.68,0:18:00.76,Default,Nk,0,0,0,,I-Impossible.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:01.76,0:18:02.97,Default,S,0,0,0,,Okay, next!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:06.81,0:18:08.19,Default,G,0,0,0,,Amazing.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:08.19,0:18:11.08,Default,S,0,0,0,,The Oda army will eventually use this technique at Nagashino.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:11.08,0:18:12.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Three squads firing in sequence.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:13.16,0:18:14.74,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,They ran away.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:14.74,0:18:17.10,Default,S,0,0,0,,No, they'll come back.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:17.53,0:18:20.37,Default,S,0,0,0,,Goemon, run to Mino.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:20.37,0:18:22.72,Default,S,0,0,0,,Get the Viper to Oumi.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:22.72,0:18:23.54,Default,G,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:23.54,0:18:27.72,Default,S,0,0,0,,If we scare the Asai, our chances of survival rise.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:27.72,0:18:28.54,Default,S,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:28.54,0:18:31.42,Default,G,0,0,0,,U-Understood!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:32.05,0:18:35.92,Default,G,0,0,0,,Everyone, pwrotect Shwagara for me!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:35.92,0:18:40.45,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,We can't refuse when you're tripping over your tongue like that.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:40.45,0:18:42.86,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,The boss's orders are absolute.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:42.86,0:18:44.93,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,Leave the chief monkey to us.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:46.93,0:18:48.20,Default,G,0,0,0,,Sagara!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:49.27,0:18:50.61,Default,G,0,0,0,,Good luck!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:53.62,0:18:56.11,Default,S,0,0,0,,The guys always get the worst jobs.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:56.64,0:18:58.53,Default,Soldiers,0,0,0,,It's fine, brother.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:58.53,0:19:02.37,Default,Soldiers,0,0,0,,We're all prepared to lay down our lives for you.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:02.37,0:19:05.18,Default,Soldiers,0,0,0,,We'll protect you, chief!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:05.18,0:19:08.00,Default,Soldiers,0,0,0,,You're our star of hope!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:12.28,0:19:15.13,Default,S,0,0,0,,What good does being popular with guys do me?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:16.22,0:19:18.62,Default,Han,0,0,0,,That's what's odd about you.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:18.62,0:19:20.60,Default,S,0,0,0,,You're a weird one yourself.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:22.41,0:19:24.27,Default,S,0,0,0,,Now we withdraw!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:24.27,0:19:26.72,Default,S,0,0,0,,Run as fast as you can!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:30.44,0:19:32.52,Default,K,0,0,0,,We will now enter Kutsuki Valley.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:33.05,0:19:36.55,Default,K,0,0,0,,Once we're through here, it's a straight line to Kyo.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:36.55,0:19:37.78,Default,K,0,0,0,,Let's do it.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:40.18,0:19:41.40,Default,N,0,0,0,,Monkey...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:44.66,0:19:47.69,Default,N,0,0,0,,I... I have to go back.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:47.69,0:19:50.91,Default,N,0,0,0,,There's no point in surviving in a world without him.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:51.56,0:19:53.37,Default,Nh,0,0,0,,Get a hold of yourself, Princess!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:53.37,0:19:54.67,Default,K,0,0,0,,Monkey isn't dead!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:54.67,0:19:56.06,Default,N,0,0,0,,He'll die!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:56.81,0:19:59.67,Default,N,0,0,0,,I left him in front of that huge army.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:00.69,0:20:02.90,Default,K,0,0,0,,He stayed there on his own!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:02.90,0:20:04.56,Default,K,0,0,0,,For you!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:06.71,0:20:09.84,Default,N,0,0,0,,No. I ordered him to.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:09.84,0:20:10.93,Default,N,0,0,0,,I made him—
Dialogue: 10,0:20:16.78,0:20:18.48,Default,I,0,0,0,,If you don't keep going
Dialogue: 10,0:20:18.48,0:20:20.86,Default,,0,0,0,,there was no point in him staying!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:20.86,0:20:22.56,Default,I,0,0,0,,I can't stand for that.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:23.63,0:20:24.86,Default,I,0,0,0,,Inuchiyo...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:30.57,0:20:32.08,Default,K,0,0,0,,I'll hold them off!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:32.47,0:20:34.32,Default,K,0,0,0,,Everyone, follow me!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:35.71,0:20:38.51,Default,Nh,0,0,0,,So, Kutsuki Valley betrayed us, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:38.51,0:20:42.72,Default,D,0,0,0,,No, it's probably another force from Odani Castle.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:43.51,0:20:48.60,Default,D,0,0,0,,The lord of Kutsuki Valley is Kutsuki Mototsuna, an indecisive man.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:49.71,0:20:52.34,Default,D,0,0,0,,I'll bring him to our side.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:57.56,0:20:59.07,Default,Nh,0,0,0,,Let's go, Princess.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:59.59,0:21:01.92,Default,Nh,0,0,0,,Shed what equipment you can and run.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:03.54,0:21:04.52,Default,N,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:04.52,0:21:06.28,Default,Nh,0,0,0,,Everyone's working as hard as they can
Dialogue: 10,0:21:06.83,0:21:10.68,Default,Nh,0,0,0,,just to make sure you survive.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:13.21,0:21:14.22,Default,N,0,0,0,,Monkey...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:18.47,0:21:21.84,Default,Konoe,0,0,0,,The Oda forces are being routed at Kanegasaki.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:21.84,0:21:25.34,Default,T,0,0,0,,But she isn't an easy woman to kill.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:25.34,0:21:27.84,Default,T,0,0,0,,If she returns to Kyo...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:28.59,0:21:30.02,Default,Konoe,0,0,0,,She won't...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:30.77,0:21:32.22,Default,Konoe,0,0,0,,ever.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:35.32,0:21:36.87,Default,N,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can't cry.{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:21:36.87,0:21:40.78,Default,N,0,0,0,,{\i1}If I fall apart here, Monkey will get mad.{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:21:42.61,0:21:43.49,Default,N,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm sure he's alive.{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:21:44.11,0:21:45.45,Default,N,0,0,0,,{\i1}He's always been crazy,{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:21:45.85,0:21:48.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}but he's never broken a promise.{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:21:49.03,0:21:53.33,Default,N,0,0,0,,{\i1}If he keeps his promise, I'll keep mine.{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:21:54.43,0:21:56.04,Default,N,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll make it home alive!{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:22:09.03,0:22:12.01,Default,N,0,0,0,,{\i1}I've been shot.{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:22:15.49,0:22:17.06,Default,N,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yoshiharu...{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:22:18.49,0:22:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm sorry.{\i0}
